You need to meet the performance requirements for RetailDW and investigate the issue with the StoreSales reports. You write the following T-SQL statements:
```sql
SELECT TOP 10 query_hash, number_of_runs, last_run_command FROM queryinsights.[1] ORDER BY [2] DESC;
SELECT sql_pool_name, timestamp FROM queryinsights.[3] WHERE [4] = 1 AND timestamp >= DATEADD(DAY, -7, GETUTCDATE());
```
How should you complete the statements? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.
